    "Busco a alguien que pueda pararla.": "找人来制止他们。",
    "I look for someone who can stop it.": "找人来制止他们。",
    "Lo observo todo desde lejos.": "在远处观察情况。",
    "I watch everything from afar.": "在远处观察情况。",
    "Me río y animo a los dos.": "笑着给双方加油。",
    "I laugh and cheer both of them on.": "笑着给双方加油。",
    "Te encuentras una cartera en el suelo.": "你在地上捡到一个钱包。",
    "You find a wallet on the ground.": "你在地上捡到一个钱包。",
    "La llevo enseguida a la policía.": "马上交给警察。",
    "I take it to the police right away.": "马上交给警察。",
    "Busco a su dueño aunque tarde horas.": "寻找失主，花几个小时也无所谓。",
    "I look for its owner even if it takes hours.": "寻找失主，花几个小时也无所谓。",
    "Primero miro qué hay dentro…": "先看看里面有什么…",
    "First I check what's inside…": "先看看里面有什么…",
    "Ni la toco, no vaya a ser.": "为了保险起见，碰都不碰。",
    "I don't even touch it, just in case.": "为了保险起见，碰都不碰。",
    "Mañana tienes un examen importante.": "明天有一场重要考试。",
    "You have an important exam tomorrow.": "明天有一场重要考试。",
    "Estudio hasta las tantas.": "熬夜学习。",
    "I study until late at night.": "熬夜学习。",
    "Repaso lo justo: confío en mí.": "稍微复习一下，相信自己。",
    "I review just enough: I trust myself.": "稍微复习一下，相信自己。",
    "Me agobio muchísimo.": "紧张得不行。",
    "I get really stressed.": "紧张得不行。",
    "¿Examen? Ya veré mañana.": "考试？明天再说。",
    "Exam? I'll see tomorrow.": "考试？明天再说。",
    "Alguien se burla de ti delante de todos.": "有人在众人面前嘲笑你。",
    "Someone mocks you in front of everyone.": "有人在众人面前嘲笑你。",
    "Le contesto en el acto.": "当场反驳。",
    "I answer back on the spot.": "当场反驳。",
    "Le devuelvo una broma mejor.": "用更好笑的笑话回敬。",
    "I hit back with a better joke.": "用更好笑的笑话回敬。",
    "Le ignoro por completo.": "完全无视。",
    "I ignore them completely.": "完全无视。",
    "Me afecta, aunque no lo diga.": "虽然不说出来，但心里很难过。",
    "It hurts, even if I don't say it.": "虽然不说出来，但心里很难过。",
    "¿Qué es lo más importante para ti?": "什么对你最重要？",
    "What matters most to you?": "什么对你最重要？",
    "Ser el mejor.": "成为最强。",
    "Being the best.": "成为最强。",
    "La amistad.": "友谊。",
    "Friendship.": "友谊。",
    "La libertad.": "自由。",
    "Freedom.": "自由。",
    "La calma.": "平静。",
    "Calm.": "平静。",
    "El camino se divide: uno oscuro y corto, otro largo y soleado.": "岔路口：一条又黑又短，一条阳光明媚但很长。",
    "The path splits: one dark and short, the other long and sunny.": "岔路口：一条又黑又短，一条阳光明媚但很长。",
    "El oscuro, ¡más emoción!": "走黑的那条，更刺激！",
    "The dark one, more excitement!": "走黑的那条，更刺激！",
    "El largo, sin prisa.": "走长的那条，不着急。",
    "The long one, no rush.": "走长的那条，不着急。",
    "Me siento a pensarlo un rato.": "坐下来好好想想。",
    "I sit down to think it over.": "坐下来好好想想。",
    "Ninguno: abro un atajo nuevo.": "都不选，自己开辟一条捷径。",
    "Neither: I make a new shortcut.": "都不选，自己开辟一条捷径。",
    "¿Qué dicen de ti tus amigos?": "朋友们会怎么评价你？",
    "What do your friends say about you?": "朋友们会怎么评价你？",
    "Que siempre pueden contar conmigo.": "总是值得信赖。",
    "That they can always count on me.": "总是值得信赖。",
    "Que soy lo más divertido del grupo.": "是大家当中最有趣的人。",
    "That I'm the funniest one in the group.": "是大家当中最有趣的人。",
    "Que soy un poco misterioso.": "有点神秘。",
    "That I'm a bit mysterious.": "有点神秘。",
    "Que no me rindo nunca.": "从不放弃。",
    "That I never give up.": "从不放弃。",
    "Tu día libre ideal es…": "你理想中的休息日是…",
    "Your ideal day off is…": "你理想中的休息日是…",
    "Entrenar para ser mejor.": "训练，让自己变得更强。",
    "Training to get better.": "训练，让自己变得更强。",
    "Quedar con todos mis amigos.": "和所有朋友一起玩。",
    "Hanging out with all my friends.": "和所有朋友一起玩。",
    "Una aventura sin ningún plan.": "来一场毫无计划的冒险。",
    "An adventure with no plan at all.": "来一场毫无计划的冒险。",
    "Leer, pensar, estar tranquilo.": "阅读、思考、享受宁静。",
    "Reading, thinking, being calm.": "阅读、思考、享受宁静。",
    "No te lo piensas dos veces cuando alguien necesita ayuda.": "有人需要帮助时，你总是毫不犹豫。",
    "You don't think twice when someone needs help.": "有人需要帮助时，你总是毫不犹豫。",
    "Tus amigos saben que pueden contar contigo siempre.": "朋友们知道，你永远值得依靠。",
    "Your friends know they can always count on you.": "朋友们知道，你永远值得依靠。",
    "Mides cada paso antes de darlo.": "每迈出一步之前，你都会仔细考虑。",
    "You measure every step before taking it.": "每迈出一步之前，你都会仔细考虑。",
    "Contagias energía allá donde vas.": "无论走到哪里，你都充满活力。",
    "You spread energy wherever you go.": "无论走到哪里，你都充满活力。",
    "Mantienes la calma cuando todo se complica.": "情况复杂时，你依然保持冷静。",
    "You keep calm when things get complicated.": "情况复杂时，你依然保持冷静。",
    "Actúas primero y piensas después. ¡A veces sale bien!": "先行动再思考，有时还真管用！",
    "You act first and think later. Sometimes it works!": "先行动再思考，有时还真管用！",
    "Te exiges ser el mejor, y casi siempre lo consigues.": "你努力追求最好，而且几乎总能做到。",
    "You push yourself to be the best, and you almost always are.": "你努力追求最好，而且几乎总能做到。",
    "Siempre tienes una broma preparada.": "你总有笑话可以讲。",
    "You always have a joke ready.": "你总有笑话可以讲。",
    "Vas a tu aire y no te importa.": "你我行我素，不在意别人怎么看。",
    "You do your own thing and don't care.": "你我行我素，不在意别人怎么看。",
    "Te cuesta dar el primer paso, pero sientes mucho.": "你很难迈出第一步，但内心感情丰富。",
    "It's hard for you to take the first step, but you feel deeply.": "你很难迈出第一步，但内心感情丰富。",
    "Nada te altera. Nada.": "没有什么能让你慌张，真的没有。",
    "Nothing fazes you. Nothing.": "没有什么能让你慌张，真的没有。",
    "Sabes esperar el momento justo.": "你知道如何等待合适的时机。",
    "You know how to wait for the right moment.": "你知道如何等待合适的时机。",
    "Ni tú sabes qué vas a hacer después.": "连你自己都不知道下一步会做什么。",
    "Not even you know what you'll do next.": "连你自己都不知道下一步会做什么。",
    "Rendirse no entra en tus planes.": "你的计划里没有放弃。",
    "Giving up isn't in your plans.": "你的计划里没有放弃。",
