    "Si eres titular de derechos y quieres que retiremos algo, escríbenos y lo quitaremos lo antes posible:": "如果你是权利人并希望移除相关内容，请联系我们，我们会尽快处理：",
    "If you are a rights holder and want something removed, write to us and we'll take it down as soon as possible:": "如果你是权利人并希望移除相关内容，请联系我们，我们会尽快处理：",
